s. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le16ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "Dear diary:<br /><br /><p>I have a class in an hour, so I'll have to make this short.</p>That job seminar has me so pumped up right now. All the things I learned there should be implemented into my job search.\nI think these skills will help me become more productive but first, I need a cover letter. My instructor at the seminar suggested that a cover letter didn't have to be included with your r\u00e9sum\u00e9. I disagreed with him, interrupting politely of course, and we debated it, but by the end, he still implied that cover letters were superfluous.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le16ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "Nevertheless, I believe a cover letter has to be done and that it is a big part of the process.  For me, the cover letter comes first, then the r\u00e9sum\u00e9 and finally the interview.\nI feel that a cover letter gives you a chance to sell yourself and explain what you will bring to the table. The employer must be sold on your capabilities.", "id": 2, "time": "35000", "image": "engenn9le16ob02re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "So today, I am going to write a cover letter, for a company I'm curious about called BFP.\nFirst, I'm going to cut to the chase, and  explain why I'm writing to them. Next, the organization should be complimented. I am going to tell BFP why I like them and want to join their organization. Then, I am customizing my cover letter, explaining all the different ways that I can meet the company's objectives. Finally, in my conclusion, I will point out my enthusiasm for the position and how much I want to meet with them and just like that, I'm finished.<br /><br />\nOops. My class starts in five minutes. Got to go.", "id": 3, "time": "57000", "image": "engenn9le16ob02re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le16ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le16ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}